    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, we're looking at the rollout for the legacy SQL DB and the new Azure Cloud API. The board is breathing down my neck to get this integration live by Friday to avoid missing the Q3 window. Can we just go ahead with a direct integration to keep things moving, or is there some massive compatibility issue that's gonna blow up our timeline? I'm really hoping we can skip the middleware step to save time.",
